      CMSMAKE  FILELIST *  -- this file
      CMSMAKE  README   *  -- do what it says, read it
      CMSMAKE  LICENSE  *  -- simplified legal stuff
*
      MAKE     EXEC     *  -- the 'make' command (wraps the pipeline)
      MAKE     REXX     *  -- 'make' as a CMS Pipelines stage, version 2.0.43
      CMSMAKE  CMSMAKE  *  -- simple 'make' rules for [re]packaging CMS Make
      _GENERIC CMSMAKE  *  -- rules for everything
      _DEFAULT CMSMAKE  *  -- rules for when you don't name a makefile
* make -f cmsmake archives
*
      MAKE     HELPCMS  *  -- brief help
*     OVERVIEW HELPMAKE *  -- missing
      VARIABLES HELPMAKE *  --
      CMSMKCC  EXEC     *  -- C compiler wrapper
      CMSMKCC  HELPCMS  *  -- help for the C compiler wrapper
      CMSMKAS  EXEC     *  -- assembler wrapper
      CMSMKAS  HELPCMS  *  -- help for the assembler wrapper
      CMSMKLD  EXEC     *  -- link/load wrapper
      CMSMKLD  HELPCMS  *  -- help for the link/load wrapper
      ADDLIB   EXEC     *  -- add GLOBAL libraries as needed
      DMSBR14  S        *  --
      HELLO    C        *  -- Hello, World!
      SLEEP    C        *  --
      UNAME    C        *  --
      CMSMAKE  H        *  -- #define MAKE_VERSION "2.0.43"
*
      WGET     EXEC     *  -- the 'wget' command (wraps the pipeline)
      WGET     REXX     *  -- 'wget' as a CMS Pipelines stage, version 2.0.43
      WGET     HELPCMS  *  -- help for the 'wget' workalike
      CURL     EXEC     *  -- the 'curl' command (wraps the pipeline)
      CURL     REXX     *  -- 'curl' as a CMS Pipelines stage, version 2.0.43
      CURL     HELPCMS  *  -- help fo the 'curl' workalike
      TOUCH    EXEC     *  -- stamp time/date on a file, version 2.0.43
      TOUCH    HELPCMS  *  -- help for 'touch' command
      RM       EXEC     *  -- Unix equivalent of 'delete', version 2.0.43
      UPTIME   EXEC     *  -- make_version = "2.0.43"
      UPTIME   HELPCMS  *  --
      HOSTNAME EXEC     *  --
      HOST     REXX     *  --
      HOST     EXEC     *  -- common wrapper around the pipeline
*
      NEW      EXEC     *  --
      NEW      HELPCMS  *  --
*
      UUENCODE EXEC     *  --
      UUENCODE REXX     *  --
      UUENCODE HELPCMS  *  --
      UUDECODE EXEC     *  --
      UUDECODE REXX     *  --
      UUDECODE HELPCMS  *  --
